  "date": "2026-11-28T16:29:54Z",
  "subject": "feat(nexus): per-registry docker proxies for the metal1 restricted network",
  "body": "metal1 pulled ~82 GB from cdn01.quay.io through squid in 26h and also reaches\ndocker.io, ghcr.io, mirror.gcr.io and registry.access.redhat.com directly. Add a\nNexus proxy, connector and ingress host for each of the missing ones\n(ghcr-io gets its own connector, plus mirror-gcr-io and access-redhat-com) so\neach source can be mirrored to its own host: tag pulls cannot be resolved\nunambiguously through a shared group repo.\n\nAdd docs/metal1-restricted-network.md with the mirror sets, squid allowlist and\nthe cutover order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
